      </div>
      <div class="arrow">▼ <small>Phase 2, through proxy leaders</small></div>
      <div class="box">acceptor grid <small>of the segment in force</small></div>
      <div class="arrow">▼ <small>chosen</small></div>
      <div class="box">replica set <small>applies in slot order · serves reads</small></div>
